DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11740::$$$message_0094_0000_0000$$$::I walk in the downtown area in front of the Shinto station, while wiping the sweat off my forehead.[lr]::
11741::$$$message_0094_0000_0001$$$::I've felt the depth of autumn recently as the days have gotten shorter, but for some reason today is...[lr]::
11742::$$$message_0094_0000_0002$$$::"It's hot for once."[lr]::
11743::$$$message_0094_0000_0003$$$::I should've put a hat on.[lr]::
11744::$$$message_0094_0000_0004$$$::As I'm looking for shade, I run into someone I know.::
11745::$$$message_0094_0001_0000$$$::"Yo... Tohsaka, what are you looking at?"[lr]::
11746::$$$message_0094_0001_0001$$$::"Huh... [cacheimage storage=凛私服01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服01a(中) time=300]Oh, it's you, Emiya."[lr]::
11747::$$$message_0094_0001_0002$$$::I look in the direction that Tohsaka is facing to see what is attracting her attention.::
11748::$$$message_0094_0002_0000$$$::"Umm... 'Waku Waku Zabuun'?"[lr]::
11749::$$$message_0094_0002_0001$$$::"Yeah. I didn't notice until now, but they built that pool."::
11750::$$$message_0094_0003_0000$$$::That is an indoor water park, unaffected by weather, that opened in Shinto this summer.[lr]::
11751::$$$message_0094_0003_0001$$$::From a water slide to a wave pool in an indoor dome, it's advertised that you can feel like it's summer at any time.::
11752::$$$message_0094_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah, I think it just opened in July. I remember seeing it in a newspaper ad."[lr]::
11753::$$$message_0094_0004_0001$$$::"You never fail to keep a tab on things like a housewife. [cacheimage storage=凛私服03g(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服03g(中) time=300]I wonder what it's like."[lr]::
11754::$$$message_0094_0004_0002$$$::"I don't know anyone who went... Come to think of it, your house is a Western-style house, but do you have a private pool?"::
11755::$$$message_0094_0005_0000$$$::"Huh? I do. I don't use it since it's a waste of money."[lr]::
11756::$$$message_0094_0005_0001$$$::She immediately replies like it's natural.[lr]::
11757::$$$message_0094_0005_0002$$$::...Oof. A wonderful reply, just as a commoner would expect from someone who lives in that mansion.::
11758::$$$message_0094_0006_0000$$$::"Just letting you know it's too small to compare to that thing. It's only about fifteen meters."[lr]::
11759::$$$message_0094_0006_0001$$$::"It's not about how big it is.[lr]::
11760::$$$message_0094_0006_0002$$$::Normal houses don't even have a pool to begin with."[lr]::
11761::$$$message_0094_0006_0003$$$::Dammit, you bourgeoise![lr]::
11762::$$$message_0094_0006_0004$$$::Slip and fall by the poolside.::
11763::$$$message_0094_0007_0000$$$::"What? You want to use my pool?"[lr]::
11764::$$$message_0094_0007_0001$$$::"...Well, at least once.[lr]::
11765::$$$message_0094_0007_0002$$$::It makes me want to experience what a private pool is like."[lr]::
11766::$$$message_0094_0007_0003$$$::"Wow, that's surprising. I didn't think you were the type to enjoy leisure activities."::
11767::$$$message_0094_0008_0000$$$::"Well, I just happened to get curious.[lr]::
11768::$$$message_0094_0008_0001$$$::Shinji dragged me to the theaters the other day.[lr]::
11769::$$$message_0094_0008_0002$$$::And the movie was about this granddaughter of a billionaire who lives in a mansion and falls in love with a stranger with no family."::
11770::$$$message_0094_0009_0000$$$::"Going to the movies spontaneously is nice, but...that's an odd choice for two guys."::
11771::$$$message_0094_0010_0000$$$::"Well, just listen. As the guy lives a life full of getting hurt, he becomes the one hurting others.[lr]::
11772::$$$message_0094_0010_0001$$$::The heroine opens up his closed heart with her mysterious atmosphere and uninhibited charm."[lr]::
11773::$$$message_0094_0010_0002$$$::"I see... Hm..."::
11774::$$$message_0094_0011_0000$$$::"Yeah, it was entertaining.[lr]::
11775::$$$message_0094_0011_0001$$$::But, the heroine starts to get enchanted by the guy, who stimulates her maternal instincts, and they decide to run off together.[lr]::
11776::$$$message_0094_0011_0002$$$::On the last night at that mansion, there's a scene where they flirt together in the pool. [wvl][se storage=se556.wav]It was a series of juicy shots that could be made into a photo book, and it's still ingrained in my mind."::
11777::$$$message_0094_0012_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服03c(中)][say storage=cty0109_rin_0090 name=凛]I see. That's a good movie."::
11778::$$$message_0094_0013_0000$$$::Of course.[lr]::
11779::$$$message_0094_0013_0001$$$::The guy gets caught cheating and is killed by the heroine, and the trauma of the shocking ending of the corpse floating in the pool remains in my mind.[lr]::
11780::$$$message_0094_0013_0002$$$::Hm, or was the girl the one who got killed?::
11781::$$$message_0094_0014_0000$$$::"...Well, fine.[lr]::
11782::$$$message_0094_0014_0001$$$::If that's the case, then I wouldn't mind considering the pool."[lr]::
11783::$$$message_0094_0014_0002$$$::"Wait, really?"::
11784::$$$message_0094_0015_0000$$$::"I figured I could forget about the weight on my mind sometimes... All right, I'll allow it.[lr]::
11785::$$$message_0094_0015_0001$$$::We made a promise that you would train for a whole day too.[lr]::
11786::$$$message_0094_0015_0002$$$::After I've fully taught you, I shall reward you by opening up the pool."[lr]::
11787::$$$message_0094_0015_0003$$$::What kind of change of heart was that?[lr]::
11788::$$$message_0094_0015_0004$$$::Tohsaka is suddenly in a good mood now.::
11789::$$$message_0094_0016_0000$$$::"Hm... Then, you'll lift the ban off of the Tohsaka household pool. It's a promise. Don't try to ask me for half of the water bill later."[lr]::
11790::$$$message_0094_0016_0001$$$::"Yes, I wouldn't do anything so careless.[lr]::
11791::$$$message_0094_0016_0002$$$::...Heheh, then you can look forward to next summer."[lr]::
11792::$$$message_0094_0016_0003$$$::Tohsaka smirks happily.[lr]::
11793::$$$message_0094_0016_0004$$$::It seems like she's having fun looking down on the poor.::
11794::$$$message_0094_0017_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, can I bring Saber?"[lr]::
11795::$$$message_0094_0017_0001$$$::There won't be another opportunity like this.[lr]::
11796::$$$message_0094_0017_0002$$$::It would be a waste for me to keep it all to myself.::
11797::$$$message_0094_0018_0000$$$::"...What do you mean?"[lr]::
11798::$$$message_0094_0018_0001$$$::"Well, it's boring swimming alone."[lr]::
11799::$$$message_0094_0018_0002$$$::"Alone...?"[lr]::
11800::$$$message_0094_0018_0003$$$::"So let's call everyone over and go all out. Not just Saber, but invite Sakura and Rider too."[lr]::
11801::$$$message_0094_0018_0004$$$::I count the members at my place with my fingers.::
11802::$$$message_0094_0019_0000$$$::"Even if Illya's castle where it's always winter has a hot spring, there probably isn't a pool if it's always that cold. I'm sure she would be happy if we invited her.[lr]::
11803::$$$message_0094_0019_0001$$$::Oh, then we'd have to invite Fuji-nee or else she'll sulk."::
11804::$$$message_0094_0020_0000$$$::"Hey, Emiya."[lr]::
11805::$$$message_0094_0020_0001$$$::"Oh yeah, sorry for being inconsiderate."[lr]::
11806::$$$message_0094_0020_0002$$$::"Ahh, there's a limit to how inconsiderate you can be."[lr]::
11807::$$$message_0094_0020_0003$$$::"You're saying we should invite Mitsuzuri or Makidera and the others. Of course, the more the merrier."[lr]::
11808::$$$message_0094_0020_0004$$$::"No, you blockhead!"::
11809::$$$message_0094_0021_0000$$$::"Mrgh, what? We'll clean up. While we're hanging in the pool, you can rest in the house."[lr]::
11810::$$$message_0094_0021_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
11811::$$$message_0094_0021_0002$$$::I don't know what Tohsaka doesn't like, but she goes silent.::
11812::$$$message_0094_0022_0000$$$::"Oh... Yeah, it might get a bit loud.[lr]::
11813::$$$message_0094_0022_0001$$$::But, it's a private pool, right? We can be noisy without causing trouble to others, so we can let loose and do all sorts of things we can't do in public."::
11814::$$$message_0094_0023_0000$$$::You can't float a rubber boat in the pool or have a barbeque party in a public facility.[lr]::
11815::$$$message_0094_0023_0001$$$::I'm getting excited just thinking about it.::
11816::$$$message_0094_0024_0000$$$::"Right? Isn't that fine?"[lr]::
11817::$$$message_0094_0024_0001$$$::"Of course notttttt![lr]::
11818::$$$message_0094_0024_0002$$$::What are you thinking of, you beast!!!!!!"[rf][lr]::
11819::$$$message_0094_0024_0003$$$::"Ah...!"[lr]::
11820::$$$message_0094_0024_0004$$$::I wake up from a burning sensation.[lr]::
11821::$$$message_0094_0024_0005$$$::The asphalt that burns from the sun is hot.::
11822::$$$message_0094_0025_0000$$$::"Ou...c...h..."[fadein textoff=0 time=200 storage=white][lr]::
11823::$$$message_0094_0025_0001$$$::I can't bear it and lie on my back.::
11824::$$$message_0094_0026_0000$$$::"In my yard...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]in front of me...[cacheimage storage=凛私服14a頬(近)]...[wvl canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se054.wav][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=凛私服14a頬(近)]What are you planning to do? I can't believe it, you Archer![lr]::
11825::$$$message_0094_0026_0001$$$::I've decided on it, I won't let anyone other than you inside!"::
11826::$$$message_0094_0027_0000$$$::"Wha...!?[lr]::
11827::$$$message_0094_0027_0001$$$::Wait, why did you reach such a conclusion!? I don't remember being favored!"[lr]::
11828::$$$message_0094_0027_0002$$$::"Remem...[cacheimage storage=凛私服11f(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服11f(近)]you...[wvl canskip=0 time=200]you...ugh, [cacheimage storage=凛私服17a頬(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=7][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=200 storage=凛私服17a頬(近)]you're so thickheaded it makes me irritated!"::
11829::$$$message_0094_0028_0000$$$::"What do you mean? Calm down and tell me why, Tohsaka."[lr]::
11830::$$$message_0094_0028_0001$$$::"Huh? [cacheimage storage=凛私服12b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服12b(中)]...You're acting defiant all of a sudden."[lr]::
11831::$$$message_0094_0028_0002$$$::"Yeah. I definitely might be a little thickheaded."[lr]::
11832::$$$message_0094_0028_0003$$$::"...A little?"::
11833::$$$message_0094_0029_0000$$$::"Sorry, a lot.[lr]::
11834::$$$message_0094_0029_0001$$$::Well. That's why, um, I won't know unless you tell me clearly. I need your explanation."[lr]::
11835::$$$message_0094_0029_0002$$$::"S...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]So that...[wvl canskip=0 time=500]means..."[lr]::
11836::$$$message_0094_0029_0003$$$::"I see, so you need to explain this first."[lr]::
11837::$$$message_0094_0029_0004$$$::"Yes, thanks... [cacheimage storage=凛私服14a(中)][wvl][se storage=se054.wav][shock vmax=30 time=400 count=4][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服14a(中)]No! [wvs][clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=048_ピカ]No, that's not it!"[wvs][clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=048_ピカ]::
11838::$$$message_0094_0030_0000$$$::"I-[wvl canskip=0 time=300]I-[wvl canskip=0 time=300]I said you're going to clean my pool, so I'm only going to invite you!"[lr]::
11839::$$$message_0094_0030_0001$$$::"...I didn't make a promise like that."[lr]::
11840::$$$message_0094_0030_0002$$$::Well, I was planning to clean by myself.::
11841::$$$message_0094_0031_0000$$$::I recall cleaning before opening the pool at Homurahara.[lr]::
11842::$$$message_0094_0031_0001$$$::It's a big task of emptying the pool of five hundred meters and eight lanes, picking up trash, washing off the moss with a scrub brush, and disinfecting all sides.[lr]::
11843::$$$message_0094_0031_0002$$$::It was originally the duty of the swimming club, but I'd dealt with it for three whole years before I realized. So I have enough experience.::
11844::$$$message_0094_0032_0000$$$::"T-There's no need to make such a promise.[lr]::
11845::$$$message_0094_0032_0001$$$::Trying to use my pool without any compensation goes against the principle of fair exchange!"[lr]::
11846::$$$message_0094_0032_0002$$$::Mrgh. Not bad, fooling me from the start and planning to boss me around.[lr]::
11847::$$$message_0094_0032_0003$$$::That's why I can't let my guard down in front of Tohsaka.::
11848::$$$message_0094_0033_0000$$$::"Fine. Then we'll all clean the pool together, so will you allow it?"[lr]::
11849::$$$message_0094_0033_0001$$$::"...You really don't get it.[lr]::
11850::$$$message_0094_0033_0002$$$::I'm saying that I don't want to let such a big party into my place!"::
11851::$$$message_0094_0034_0000$$$::"Huh? But you're close with everyone."[lr]::
11852::$$$message_0094_0034_0001$$$::"That's a different story![lr]::
11853::$$$message_0094_0034_0002$$$::Why would you bring so many people even though it's a private pool!?"::
11854::$$$message_0094_0035_0000$$$::"Huh? [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Umm, so it's not your style to have fun with a large crowd.[lr]::
11855::$$$message_0094_0035_0001$$$::Fine, then I'll look after your house while you're away too.[lr]::
11856::$$$message_0094_0035_0002$$$::As a fair exchange, will you open the pool to Saber and the others? It's fine if they use it quietly, right?"::
11857::$$$message_0094_0036_0000$$$::"[cacheimage storage=凛私服14a頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se065.wav][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=5][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服14a頬(中)]No way!!![cacheimage storage=凛私服17頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服17頬(中)] Your slowness is hopeless! Dammit, have you gone crazy from this heat!?"[rf]::
11858::$$$message_0094_0037_0000$$$::"Hnng...!?!?!?"[lr]::
11859::$$$message_0094_0037_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Guh... Oof, ah, ah... S-Shoot, I feel like I made her mood much worse.[font italic=false]::
11860::$$$message_0094_0038_0000$$$::"Just don't think anymore, okay!?[lr]::
11861::$$$message_0094_0038_0001$$$::You're the only one that can use my pool; I won't ever let Saber and the others use it![lr]::
11862::$$$message_0094_0038_0002$$$::Got it!? Repeat after me, yes!"::
11863::$$$message_0094_0039_0000$$$::"Huh...? Oh, yes, I'm the only one who can use your pool...I think?"[lr]::
11864::$$$message_0094_0039_0001$$$::"Your reaction is slow! 'I'm the only one who will use your pool, we are the only ones who will hang in the pool!' [wvl][se storage=se054.wav][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-4]Repeat after me!"[lr]::
11865::$$$message_0094_0039_0002$$$::"Uh, I'm the only one who will use your pool, we are the only ones who will hang in your pool!"::
11866::$$$message_0094_0040_0000$$$::"You're slow, one more time![cacheimage storage=凛私服05e頬(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服05e頬(近)] Listen. 'I'm the only one who will use your pool, we are the only ones who will hang in your pool, I'm the only one you will invite to the pool,' [wvl][se storage=se054.wav][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-4]repeat after me!"[lr]::
11867::$$$message_0094_0040_0001$$$::"Ugh, I'm the only one who will use your pool, we are the only ones who will hang in your pool, I'm the only one you will invite to the pool! Is this enough!?"::
11868::$$$message_0094_0041_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...Wait, what?[font italic=false][lr]::
11869::$$$message_0094_0041_0001$$$::I feel like something I'm not used to saying got mixed in at the end.::
11870::$$$message_0094_0042_0000$$$::"Good. You can do it if you try, Shirou."[lr]::
11871::$$$message_0094_0042_0001$$$::Tohsaka is sulking in front of me.::
11872::$$$message_0094_0043_0000$$$::"Hold on. That would be an invitation to the pool...no, a date, right?"[lr]::
11873::$$$message_0094_0043_0001$$$::"Of course. You said it clearly yourself, Emiya."[lr]::
11874::$$$message_0094_0043_0002$$$::"Well... uh, I mean, I'm happy, but... So at the pool at your place?"::
11875::$$$message_0094_0044_0000$$$::"No. My pool isn't worth it. I'll take you there tomorrow or the day after tomorrow."[lr]::
11876::$$$message_0094_0044_0001$$$::There's a gigantic dome made entirely of glass in the direction that she's pointing.[lr]::
11877::$$$message_0094_0044_0002$$$::"Y-You mean Waku Waku Zabuun!?"::
11878::$$$message_0094_0045_0000$$$::"Yes, the relaxed atmosphere that reminds you of an actual European resort is appealing.[lr]::
11879::$$$message_0094_0045_0001$$$::It's a pool resort that you can enjoy all year long, since the water temperature is maintained close to 33 to 34 degrees Celsius which is close to body temperature!"[lr]::
11880::$$$message_0094_0045_0002$$$::Tohsaka reads off the advertising slogan off the billboard.[lr]::
11881::$$$message_0094_0045_0003$$$::"...Oh, well. That's impressive."::
11882::$$$message_0094_0046_0000$$$::"Then, be more [wvl][se storage=se054.wav][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-4]impressed![lr]::
11883::$$$message_0094_0046_0001$$$::The poolside has an area where you can play while enjoying the marine-like sense of feeling in the shallows that's just like the waterside of a beach. It says the mushroom slide is super popular with little kids![lr]::
11884::$$$message_0094_0046_0002$$$::Now, break down your mind and body at that eternal summer paradise that's full of variety!"::
11885::$$$message_0094_0047_0000$$$::"You mean 'release.'[lr]::
11886::$$$message_0094_0047_0001$$$::Wait, um. Was that actually reality without any jokes...?"[lr]::
11887::$$$message_0094_0047_0002$$$::"It's reality! You're going to go on a D[wvl canskip=0 time=250]A[wvl canskip=0 time=250]T[wvl canskip=0 time=250]E[cacheimage storage=凛私服12d頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服12d頬(中)] with me!!!"[playstop time=3000 nowait=true]::
11888::$$$message_0094_0048_0000$$$::"H-Hold on. A d-d-[wvl canskip=0 time=300]date is fine, but isn't having a date over there too sudden?"[lr]::
11889::$$$message_0094_0048_0001$$$::"Heh, it's too late if anything.[lr]::
11890::$$$message_0094_0048_0002$$$::I just bought a new swimsuit, so it's perfect timing. I haven't showed it to anyone yet, so I'll show you first."::
11891::$$$message_0094_0049_0000$$$::"Hnng...!?"[lr]::
11892::$$$message_0094_0049_0001$$$::The impact is like I was pierced in the heart with Gáe Bolg.[lr]::
11893::$$$message_0094_0049_0002$$$::Tohsaka's[wait canskip=0 time=350] swimsuit...?[lr]::
11894::$$$message_0094_0049_0003$$$::My breath gets taken away sometimes even when she's in her regular clothes, but wouldn't I for sure die instantly if she shows me something like that...!?::
11895::$$$message_0094_0050_0000$$$::"They'll grow more by next summer, so that swimsuit might be too sexy to wear.[lr]::
11896::$$$message_0094_0050_0001$$$::Oh, do you prefer that?"::
11897::$$$message_0094_0051_0000$$$::And they're still growing...!?[lr]::
11898::$$$message_0094_0051_0001$$$::I'm relieved she's not talking about her height... Wait![lr]::
11899::$$$message_0094_0051_0002$$$::I get nervous enough when she's wearing clothes, but wouldn't I not only die instantly but for sure become a Heroic Spirit...!?::
11900::$$$message_0094_0052_0000$$$::"Apparently you can go on the water slides with two people.[lr]::
11901::$$$message_0094_0052_0001$$$::If our bodies are stuck together from an elevation of 18 meters, and a full length of 158 meters at a speed of 40 kilometers per hour, then we'll jostle one another so much, who knows where we might touch, hehe."::
11902::$$$message_0094_0053_0000$$$::Is she trying to finish me off...!?[lr]::
11903::$$$message_0094_0053_0001$$$::I get shocked just by touching her hand, but I would not only die instantly and become a Heroic Spirit, I'd become Tohsaka's Servant for sure...!::
11904::$$$message_0094_0054_0000$$$::"...Hey. Do you still not want to go on a date even after hearing me say all this?"[lr]::
11905::$$$message_0094_0054_0001$$$::Tohsaka looks away meekly.[lr]::
11906::$$$message_0094_0054_0002$$$::I somehow swallow the saliva that's accumulated in my mouth and strain my eyes at Tohsaka, trying to see through her acting.::
11907::$$$message_0094_0055_0000$$$::I-I-[wait canskip=0 time=400]I won't get fooled.[lr]::
11908::$$$message_0094_0055_0001$$$::Tohsaka tried to get me to clean the pool as if it's natural earlier.[lr]::
11909::$$$message_0094_0055_0002$$$::Of course she's going to push some absurd demand on to me after I accept.[lr]::
11910::$$$message_0094_0055_0003$$$::If that happens, my social status will fall and I'll be a prisoner of Alcatraz, doomed to my fate.[lr]::
11911::$$$message_0094_0055_0004$$$::A date with Tohsaka is such high value, I won't be able to pay it off for the rest of my life...::
11912::$$$message_0094_0056_0000$$$::"I-[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]I won't listen! T-There's no way I can believe such a good deal!"::
11913::$$$message_0094_0057_0000$$$::"Heh. [cacheimage storage=凛私服06a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服06a(中) time=300]Yes, that's right. I have a bad personality.[lr]::
11914::$$$message_0094_0057_0001$$$::...That's why as fair exchange, I'm going to make you completely obey me during the date. I'm going to boss you around the whole day at the pool. That's only natural, right?" ::
11915::$$$message_0094_0058_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
11916::$$$message_0094_0058_0001$$$::[font italic=true]What?[font italic=false][lr]::
11917::$$$message_0094_0058_0002$$$::[font italic=true]That's all I need to do?[font italic=false]::
11918::$$$message_0094_0059_0000$$$::"Oh. If that's the condition, then I have no problem with it."[lr]::
11919::$$$message_0094_0059_0001$$$::"Huh... [cacheimage storage=凛私服09e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服09e(中)]H-Hey Shirou, you're fine with that?"[lr]::
11920::$$$message_0094_0059_0002$$$::"Of course.[lr]::
11921::$$$message_0094_0059_0003$$$::I'm asking just in case, but are you fine with something like that?"::
11922::$$$message_0094_0060_0000$$$::"Huh... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]That's nothing, but... [cacheimage storage=凛私服12d頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服12d頬(中)]If you're fine with that, I couldn't ask for anything better."[lr]::
11923::$$$message_0094_0060_0001$$$::"Then it's decided. If I can spend the whole day with you with something like that, then I feel like it's a good deal."::
11924::$$$message_0094_0061_0000$$$::First of all, obeying Tohsaka is an everyday thing.[lr]::
11925::$$$message_0094_0061_0001$$$::Nothing changes from just adding the word "completely" in front of it.::
11926::$$$message_0094_0062_0000$$$::"...Okay. [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Then it's a promise. Forget everything other than me and have fun completely obeying me."[lr]::
11927::$$$message_0094_0062_0001$$$::"It's a crazy position to be in when I hear it again, but I get it. I'll be looking forward to it."::
11928::$$$message_0094_0063_0000$$$::My mindset has already gone ahead to the day of the date.[lr]::
11929::$$$message_0094_0063_0001$$$::I wonder what Tohsaka's new swimsuit is like.[lr]::
11930::$$$message_0094_0063_0002$$$::Since I'm not interested in fashion, I have no idea what the current trend is so I can't even imagine.::
11931::$$$message_0094_0064_0000$$$::"...So. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]By the way, can I bring Saber?"[lr]::
11932::$$$message_0094_0064_0001$$$::"No. Absolute obedience, remember?"[lr]::
11933::$$$message_0094_0064_0002$$$::Tohsaka's mindset has also gone ahead to the date day.[lr]::
11934::$$$message_0094_0064_0003$$$::She refuses it flatly.::
11935::$$$message_0094_0065_0000$$$::"...Heh. All right, brace yourself.[lr]::
11936::$$$message_0094_0065_0001$$$::I'll wrap you around my finger so that you won't be able to say something silly like that."[lr]::
11937::$$$message_0094_0065_0002$$$::Tohsaka sulks, crankily looking in the other direction.[lr]::
11938::$$$message_0094_0065_0003$$$::Just like this, I made a promise to go to the pool with Tohsaka from unexpected good luck and bad luck.::
11939::$$$message_0094_0066_0000$$$::...Even so.[lr]::
11940::$$$message_0094_0066_0001$$$::When Tohsaka invited me on a date in the past, she would let Saber come, and we would go out with the three of us. I wonder what kind of a change of heart she had...::
911818::$$$message_9094_0024_0002$$$::"What are you thinking of, you beast!!!!!!"[r]::

